   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Choose a topic of interest such as your favorite vacation or your top three academic goals this year. Select the appropriate layouts for a new presentation and create a short presentation about the chosen topic. After the title slide, you need a slide that provides an overview of your presentation, followed by three slides that you will use to present pictures with captions. Your presentation should be approximately five slides long.",
